  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img height=\"113\" src=\"assets\\st0006_5253bb427257.png\" width=\"111\" /><br /><br />Intensity at distance <math><mi>r</mi></math> from a point source, <math><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><msup><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Efficiency, <math><mi>&#951;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>&#8242;</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>P</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>&#951;</mi><mi>P</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>P</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>10</mn><mn>100</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>c</mi><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msubsup><mi>E</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>c</mi><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msubsup><mi>E</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>100</mn><mrow><mn>9</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p>"
